  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一款 Serilum 模組，滿載心意而作。大量活躍模組支援 Fabric、Forge 與 Neo！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《超越三叉戟》強化了原版三叉戟的功能。您可以在無雨天氣下使用波濤附魔，只要另一隻手持有一桶水。預設情況下，本模組也讓三叉戟變得更強大，但您可在設定檔中切換此功能。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需安裝 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於《原版體驗》整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的額外合輯\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定選項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHoldBucketOfWater</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用時，波濤僅能在玩家手持水桶且無雨的情況下使用。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>tridentUseDuration</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 5，最小值 0，最大值 20</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家需要為三叉戟充能多少時間才能使用波濤。Minecraft 原版預設為 10。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>tridentUsePowerModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 3.0，最小值 0，最大值 100.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">使用時，三叉戟的波濤威力會乘以此數值。可讓玩家一次充能後飛行更遠的距離。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示影片\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>實際效果（超級好玩！）：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/transcending-trident/a.webp\" alt=\"gif0\" width=\"1000\" height=\"558\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可自由在任何整合包中使用此模組，前提是下載檔案仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統中。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言功能已關閉，因為我無法在這麼多模組頁面中一一追蹤。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
